# One feed title per line. Matching is case-insensitive; '#' starts a comment.
# Posts from these blogs are left out of the ePub AND kept unread on Feedbin,
# so you can still read them elsewhere.
#
# Tip: run `newspaper --list-feeds` to see the exact titles.

